---
layout: base.njk
title: Case Studies
description: Worked examples of HR Measured's approach — measurement design and predictive modeling applied to synthetic and illustrative HR data.
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container container--narrow">
    <div class="section-label">Case Studies</div>
    <h1>The method, worked through end to end.</h1>
    <p class="page-intro">Full walkthroughs — measurement design, model, results, and honest limitations — using synthetic or illustrative data. Not client work, but the same approach.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="insights-list">
  <div class="container container--narrow">
    {% if collections.caseStudies.length %}
      {% for study in collections.caseStudies %}
      <article class="post-preview post-preview--full">
        <time class="post-date">{{ study.date | readableDate }}</time>
        <h2><a href="{{ study.url }}">{{ study.data.title }}</a></h2>
        {% if study.data.excerpt %}<p>{{ study.data.excerpt }}</p>{% endif %}
        <a href="{{ study.url }}" class="read-more">Read &rarr;</a>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    {% else %}
      <p class="empty-state">No case studies yet — check back soon.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
